---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Process — Sanmarg : Aparajita" description="Process — Aparajita, an initiative by Sanmarg.">
<section>
        <div class="container sec-pad">
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-sm-12">
                    <span class="inside-header">
                        <h1>Process</h1>
                    </span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section class="sec-pad grad-bg">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-sm-10 mx-auto">
                    <p class="text-center intro-text mt-3 quote-font">With every renewed edition, <b>Aage Kaun</b> is how <b>Aparajita</b> discovers new stories. Through communication in the Sanmarg newspapers as well as updates on digital media and our website, <b>Aage Kaun</b> forms are released to the world. This is where <b>nominees for Aparajita</b> come from.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section class="sec-pad">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="row d-flex align-items-center">
                <div class="col-sm-6">
                    <p>Nominees are also searched for by the research and development team supporting Aparajita. All these names are added to a database and shortlisted in accordance with that edition’s categories.</p>
                    <p>Each year, a selection of outstanding nominees are reached out to for a detailed registration process. These incredible women will fill what is called an ‘insight form’.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="col-sm-4 mob-img">
                    <img src="/images/process-teaser.webp" class="img-fluid" alt="Process">
                </div>
                </div>
                <div class="row content-gap">
                    <div class="timeline">
                        <ul>
                            <li>
                                <div class="right_content">
                                    <h2>1</h2>
                                    <p>The three top profiles per category are discussed with the jury &amp; advisory panels.
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <div class="right_content">
                                    <h2>2</h2>
                                    <p>The final three nominees for each category are reached out to with exact timelines provided.
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <div class="right_content">
                                    <h2>3</h2>
                                    <p>The remaining three nominees are contacted and updated on the status of their application.
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <div class="right_content">
                                    <h2>4</h2>
                                    <p>The nominees are declared and voting begins. All voting is conducted through newspapers and social media platforms.
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <div class="right_content">
                                    <h2>5</h2>
                                    <p>Nominees then connect for conversations and deliberations with Aparajita.
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <div class="right_content">
                                    <h2>6</h2>
                                    <p>Winners are finalised by EY based on a combination of voting and interview scores.
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <div class="right_content">
                                    <h2>7</h2>
                                    <p>Outside of the Popular Awards process, a handful of outstanding women from across the nation and indeed the world are handpicked by the Jury each year to be Jury Awardees.
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <div class="right_content">
                                    <h2>8</h2>
                                    <p>The main event &#8211; our flagship ceremony &#8211; is a grand affair where the year’s Popular &amp; Jury Awardees are finally disclosed.
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                            </li>
                            <div style="clear:both;"></div>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-sm-4 mx-auto mob-img"><img src="/images/process-teaser2.webp" class="img-fluid d-flex mx-auto" alt="Process"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
    </section>
</Base>
